OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over 1993 unsolved
OL,4,ATooze murders faces no further action
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested in connection with one
OL,7,Fof Wales' most notorious unsolved
OL,8,Fmurders is no longer under
OL,9,Finvestigation, police have said.
OL,11,FHarry and Megan Tooze were found dead
OL,12,Fwith shotgun wounds in a cow shed at
OL,13,Ftheir farm in south Wales on 26 July
OL,14,F1993.
OL,16,FSouth Wales Police said an 87-year-old
OL,17,Fman who had been arrested in December
OL,18,F2025 as part of a review of evidence
OL,19,Fwas no longer under investigation and
OL,20,Fhad been released with no further
OL,21,Faction.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
